    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake to find yourself locked inside a curious house. Explore your surroundings to find clues and helpful items. Make clever connections to solve the hidden puzzles in each room. Delve into the deeper mystery of this place to uncover its true meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRACE: Definitive Edition is a remaster of the popular 2022 webgame TRACE. Praised for its puzzle design and stunning graphics, TRACE: Definitive Edition expands on the original with mind-bending new puzzles, gorgeous new visuals, and a captivating narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/28a8357895468a19176cc18ed65549e8.poster.avif?t=1742154499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/28a8357895468a19176cc18ed65549e8.webm?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/28a8357895468a19176cc18ed65549e8.mp4?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make clever connections to solve puzzles that put your mental dexterity to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGH DEFINITION GRAPHICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/797c92af93a1c7b07f7eb6497b233056.poster.avif?t=1742154499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/797c92af93a1c7b07f7eb6497b233056.webm?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/797c92af93a1c7b07f7eb6497b233056.mp4?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a surreal 3D environment in marvelous HD.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DEEPER MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/76a35c80097e2d149b6c0e18683aa9e0.poster.avif?t=1742154499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/76a35c80097e2d149b6c0e18683aa9e0.webm?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/76a35c80097e2d149b6c0e18683aa9e0.mp4?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world isn't what it seems. Witness reflections of a dark past to understand your current predicament.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake to find yourself locked inside a curious house. Explore your surroundings to find clues and helpful items. Make clever connections to solve the hidden puzzles in each room. Delve into the deeper mystery of this place to uncover its true meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRACE: Definitive Edition is a remaster of the popular 2022 webgame TRACE. Praised for its puzzle design and stunning graphics, TRACE: Definitive Edition expands on the original with mind-bending new puzzles, gorgeous new visuals, and a captivating narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/28a8357895468a19176cc18ed65549e8.poster.avif?t=1742154499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/28a8357895468a19176cc18ed65549e8.webm?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/28a8357895468a19176cc18ed65549e8.mp4?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make clever connections to solve puzzles that put your mental dexterity to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGH DEFINITION GRAPHICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/797c92af93a1c7b07f7eb6497b233056.poster.avif?t=1742154499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/797c92af93a1c7b07f7eb6497b233056.webm?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/797c92af93a1c7b07f7eb6497b233056.mp4?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a surreal 3D environment in marvelous HD.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DEEPER MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/76a35c80097e2d149b6c0e18683aa9e0.poster.avif?t=1742154499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/76a35c80097e2d149b6c0e18683aa9e0.webm?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/76a35c80097e2d149b6c0e18683aa9e0.mp4?t=1742154499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world isn't what it seems. Witness reflections of a dark past to understand your current predicament.</p>",
